          value: "Tab/Shift+Tab in product forms moves through value controls in document order: text inputs, textareas, select/combobox triggers, radio groups (one stop per group; arrows move options), UiOptionCardGroup (one stop; arrows/Home/End), checkboxes, switches, and file-upload hosts. Accessory chrome grouped with a field uses tabIndex=-1 (FormAccessorySlot, AppButton tabStop=skip, or formAccessoryTabProps): FieldHintTooltip, Settings labelInfo, AI sparkle, history icons on the label, password visibility, start/end adornment buttons, clear/copy/generate/browse/binding toggles in the same control row, chip dismiss, where-builder add/remove/drag. Relation-picker search stays (it is the field); its clear control skips. Click still works. Do not assign positive tabindex. Footer Save/Cancel/Next stay after the last field. See docs/standards/ui-core.md \xA7Form tab order",
