          value: "reuse CreateEditModalShell (src/shared/ui/CreateEditModalShell.tsx) or shared constants CREATE_EDIT_MODAL_BACKDROP_CLASS, CREATE_EDIT_MODAL_SHELL_CLASS, CREATE_EDIT_MODAL_SHELL_MAXIMIZED_CLASS, CREATE_EDIT_MODAL_HEADER_CLASS, CREATE_EDIT_MODAL_BODY_CLASS, CREATE_EDIT_MODAL_BODY_INNER_CLASS, CREATE_EDIT_MODAL_FOOTER_CLASS, CREATE_EDIT_MODAL_SIZE_CLASS, MODAL_SHELL_MAXIMIZED_CLASS from src/shared/ui/surfaceClasses.ts; each opener must pass size (auto, sm\u20135xl, maximized, or full; default auto); maximized = largest size with 16px inset (CREATE_EDIT_MODAL_BACKDROP_CLASS + size maximized); full = edge-to-edge (CREATE_EDIT_MODAL_BACKDROP_FULL_CLASS); do not use size=full when intent is maximized-with-margin; shell uses rounded-xl border unless full; body slot is edge-aligned via -mx-[15px] and CreateEditModalShell wraps children in CREATE_EDIT_MODAL_BODY_INNER_CLASS (bg-white p-[15px]) flush to body edges; body gradient only (no dotted/noisy pattern)",
