          value: "Column Properties border MODELER_PANEL_BORDER_COLUMN_CLASS (indigo-200/70); Relation Properties and Relations workspace MODELER_PANEL_BORDER_RELATION_CLASS (violet-200/70); table designer MODELER_PANEL_BORDER_DESIGNER_CLASS (slate-300/90); headers use MODELER_FLOATING_PANEL_HEADER_CLASS / TITLE / HEADER_BAND (white/slate, h-9); property summary asides border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/50 \u2014 never indigo-50 panel washes or violet page gradients; General/Identity modals stay CreateEditModalShell; see docs/standards/data-studio-modeler.md \xA7Floating studio windows",
