          value: "Data Studio modeler APIs section lists operations (method + path) from Data APIs, built-in/managed functions, and the platform catalog in baseObjectPlatformApis.ts; match by objectName (and rematch Data APIs via function metadata when edgeModelId changed); Data API rows open ConfigureDataApiDialog; function rows open the same Server Functions Settings form plus Access/Hooks; platform-only rows stay read-only and must not be republished through DataApiExecutor; see docs/standards/data-studio.md \xA7Platform API inventory",
