          value: "CRUD Set pagination is CrudSetSpec.pagination plus paging chrome: grid and kanban default on shows GridPagingFooter; paging.pattern numbered (page numbers) or prev-next; default page size 50 from the closed catalog 50/100/500/1000/10000 (pageSizes, cannot drop the last); summary and first/last default on; listModeSwitch default on with defaultListMode paging; pagination off omits the paging footer and shows the full queried set in one scroll; tree-grid and map are never paged; do not invent a second footer or cursor/load-more patterns; export still dumps the full queried set either way; see docs/standards/crud-set.md",
          appliesTo: ["CRUD Set", "GridPagingFooter", "list paging", "tree-grid"]
