          value: "CRUD Set sorting is CrudSetSpec.sorting: footer sort field + direction show on GridPagingFooter when pagination is on and sorting.footer is not false (suggest on); defaultField is the first sortable column; defaultDirection asc; those defaults apply even when the footer is off; column-header sort still follows columns[].sortable; do not put list sort in the toolbar; see docs/standards/crud-set.md",
