          value: 'CRUD Set create, form-patch, and view/delete-display bodies are RecordForm (Base Components Edit / View, palette heroui.record-form): main fields plus an optional docked side panel for formPlacement side (checkboxes, lock status) flush to header/footer/edge with equal 15px padding on the main column; default placement end (opposite theme direction); theme fill is --app-inspector-rail-bg (3.5% accent wash) and the splitter is ghost by default (WorkspaceVerticalSplitHandle appearance ghost); pin, show-title, title-in-header, and custom hex fill remain dialogs chrome; formControl and visibleWhen apply; View is read-only with no submit; patches use the Edit form; dialogs may name a designed Edit/View component; wrapping dialogs honor showHeader/showFooter; hand-written CRUD create/edit/view dialogs (Roles, Base Info, Org/Geo vocab) also render RecordForm \u2014 do not fork a parallel FormSection layout; configurators use CrudSetConfigCheckbox as a yes/no select (short label beside select); RecordForm booleans pass control="checkbox"; do not wrap each field in a second section with the same title or repeat labels; boxed KV inspector cards stay nested-editor only; see docs/standards/crud-set.md and docs/standards/ui-inspector-rail.md',
