          "**Dashboard** (`/us/studio`) \u2014 system overview and widgets. Packages can drop extra widgets into `core.dashboard.widgets`.",
          "## Development",
          "- **Data Studio** \u2014 Edge models, Sequelize runtime, published Data API.",
          "- **Server Functions** \u2014 sandboxed TypeScript/JavaScript APIs + OpenAPI.",
